<title>USA: Adaptec Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Adaptec Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				   3 Months Ended     12 Months Ended</p>
